{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >God Fishing is an experimental idle fishing game with aspects of horror and a running narrative. You solve puzzles to find the right combinations of location and bait to find certain catches. After throwing your hook, you will have to wait for a varying amount of time. Catching a fish will reveal some dialogue which will help you understand the wider narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features part 1</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different fish to catch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist pixel art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small crafting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >part 2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will be released somewhere in the future as a free update to the current game</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789090?t=1753271080","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789090/adf946dafa819eba7c5b58b16d05b25a8ca5feba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753271080","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789090/b9a13d1a2da11de1a8ffb559f26a8ac47c111a36/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753271080","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789090/b9a13d1a2da11de1a8ffb559f26a8ac47c111a36/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753271080","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >God Fishing is an experimental idle fishing game with aspects of horror and a running narrative. You solve puzzles to find the right combinations of location and bait to find certain catches. After throwing your hook, you will have to wait for a varying amount of time. Catching a fish will reveal some dialogue which will help you understand the wider narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features part 1</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different fish to catch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist pixel art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small crafting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >part 2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will be released somewhere in the future as a free update to the current game</p>","developers":["mrlepel"],"dlc":[3878350],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789090/9d30224c759a8967d46757441447854efd1a568c/header.jpg?t=1753271080","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3789090/719424724/79b882bf9be9907e06dc57c158b72ecbb1612731/1750376717/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749852150","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3789090/719424724/79b882bf9be9907e06dc57c158b72ecbb1612731/1750376717/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749852150","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3789090/719424724/79b882bf9be9907e06dc57c158b72ecbb1612731/1750376717/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749852150","id":257149377,"name":"part 1 trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257149377/3933ee4759aebec988260235d6fd74f5db3417b2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749852150"}],"name":"God Fishing","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<